"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once you have used the setup, a new 'FNAF UCN Client' will be created inside the Archipelago Launcher and open this client.\n\nOn the client, in the bottom input field, type '/patch'. Once the command is done, a new patched UCN .exe will be created next to the one that was just copied by the setup (should be at: "C:\\ProgramData\\Archipelago\\UCN\\UCN Archipelago.exe").\n\nOn the client again, in the top input field this time, type your multiworld's server address and press 'Connect' (see the 'HOSTING' tab if you want infos about generating a multiworld). When it asks you to enter your slot name, type the name attached to your YAML file, if an error message appears, simply open the patched version of the game and it should connect you and give you your starting character (UCN Archipelago.exe).",
